#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-table-navigation.md:0
msgid ""
"Configure how Orca announces cell coordinates, spans and headers and skips "
"blank cells when you navigate tables."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-table-navigation.md:7
msgid "Table navigation preferences"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-table-navigation.md:9
msgid ""
"The following options allow you to customize how Orca behaves when "
"navigating within a table in applications that support Structural "
"Navigation, see {ref}`orca-navigate-the-document-structure`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-table-navigation.md:11
msgid "Speak cell coordinates"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-table-navigation.md:13
msgid ""
"If checked, Orca announces the coordinates of each cell you navigate to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-table-navigation.md:15
#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-table-navigation.md:21
#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-table-navigation.md:27
msgid "**Default value**: checked"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-table-navigation.md:17
msgid "Speak multiple cell spans"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-table-navigation.md:19
msgid ""
"If checked, Orca announces how many rows or columns a cell spans when it "
"spans more than one."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-table-navigation.md:23
msgid "Announce cell header"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-table-navigation.md:25
msgid ""
"If checked, Orca announces changes in the header if the headers for the "
"current cell can be determined."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-table-navigation.md:29
msgid "Skip blank cells"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-table-navigation.md:31
msgid ""
"If checked, Orca skips blank cells when you are using {ref}`orca-structural-"
"navigation-commands` to access the table."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/accessibility/orca-preferences/orca-preferences-table-navigation.md:33
msgid "**Default value**: not checked"
msgstr ""
